            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 21s-6.7-4.35-9.33-8.24C.9 10.02 1.9 6.5 5.1 5.66c1.98-.52 3.9.37 4.9 1.98C11 6.03 12.92 5.14 14.9 5.66c3.2.84 4.2 4.36 2.43 7.1C18.7 16.65 12 21 12 21z" /></svg>
            <span class="act-lbl">Spara &#8594;</span>
